WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The gorilla wasn't invisible.
The viewers were concentrating on another task.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
That distinction is the difference between an interesting experiment
and a miracle claim.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In a later study, expert readers of medical scans
could miss a very large, unexpected figure.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Expertise didn't mean they were careless.
It meant the search task shaped attention.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
An audio meditation course may offer structure.
This experiment does not show it improves focus.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence. Try a free practice.
Decide whether a recording belongs in your routine.
